# Canonical Experiment 6-6 evidence is intentionally versioned.  The public
# Arena input remains ignored because it is ~2 GB; manifests bind it by URL,
# byte size, record count, and SHA-256 instead.
!validation/
!validation/**/*.json
!validation/**/*.png
!validation/**/*.html

